{"3956590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ECHO CORE", "steam_appid": 3956590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4820810], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHO CORE</strong> is a top-down sci-fi action-adventure. You awaken deep within an abandoned facility, now silent and overgrown. Its halls hide both beauty and danger, and the answers to who and what you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile machines with responsive, ability-driven combat. Explore richly atmospheric levels that tell the story of a world divided, now long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the starting weapons you can pick from: a FIREBALL. It has medium mana cost, medium range, but good AOE. Discover many other weapons and builds you can create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/a7073c3f928c4f512703c6c92199ad50.poster.avif?t=1784182494\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/a7073c3f928c4f512703c6c92199ad50.webm?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/a7073c3f928c4f512703c6c92199ad50.mp4?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the behind-the-scenes of our CRIT system. Think you have the chops for reacting fast to enemies’ attacks and anticipating them? If you hit enemies in a short window as they wind up their attack, you stun them for longer, leaving them free for an extra attack that consumes no resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/eb81335febfeb8d558b891ce5ca95849.poster.avif?t=1784182494\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/eb81335febfeb8d558b891ce5ca95849.webm?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/eb81335febfeb8d558b891ce5ca95849.mp4?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, eerie and filled with jaw-dropping mystery. Be the one to figure out what happened to this place, where everyone is and who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/3843e484b8e9411e2de86e530b311416.poster.avif?t=1784182494\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/3843e484b8e9411e2de86e530b311416.webm?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/3843e484b8e9411e2de86e530b311416.mp4?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense top-down combat</strong> with responsive controls and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy encounters that evolve</strong> as you progress deeper into the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric exploration</strong> filled with secrets, lore, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple chapters</strong>, each with new challenges and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylised visuals</strong> enhanced by atmospheric lighting and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible length</strong> designed for a focused, satisfying playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/82ab28c1d90db83454b05b2abc0386bd.avif?t=1784182494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras_big/82ab28c1d90db83454b05b2abc0386bd.avif?t=1784182494 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Chat with the community, other players and discuss mysteries!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ECHO CORE</strong> is a top-down sci-fi action-adventure. You awaken deep within an abandoned facility, now silent and overgrown. Its halls hide both beauty and danger, and the answers to who and what you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hostile machines with responsive, ability-driven combat. Explore richly atmospheric levels that tell the story of a world divided, now long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the starting weapons you can pick from: a FIREBALL. It has medium mana cost, medium range, but good AOE. Discover many other weapons and builds you can create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/a7073c3f928c4f512703c6c92199ad50.poster.avif?t=1784182494\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/a7073c3f928c4f512703c6c92199ad50.webm?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/a7073c3f928c4f512703c6c92199ad50.mp4?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the behind-the-scenes of our CRIT system. Think you have the chops for reacting fast to enemies’ attacks and anticipating them? If you hit enemies in a short window as they wind up their attack, you stun them for longer, leaving them free for an extra attack that consumes no resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/eb81335febfeb8d558b891ce5ca95849.poster.avif?t=1784182494\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/eb81335febfeb8d558b891ce5ca95849.webm?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/eb81335febfeb8d558b891ce5ca95849.mp4?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, eerie and filled with jaw-dropping mystery. Be the one to figure out what happened to this place, where everyone is and who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/3843e484b8e9411e2de86e530b311416.poster.avif?t=1784182494\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/3843e484b8e9411e2de86e530b311416.webm?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/3843e484b8e9411e2de86e530b311416.mp4?t=1784182494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense top-down combat</strong> with responsive controls and special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy encounters that evolve</strong> as you progress deeper into the facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric exploration</strong> filled with secrets, lore, and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple chapters</strong>, each with new challenges and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylised visuals</strong> enhanced by atmospheric lighting and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible length</strong> designed for a focused, satisfying playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras/82ab28c1d90db83454b05b2abc0386bd.avif?t=1784182494\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/extras_big/82ab28c1d90db83454b05b2abc0386bd.avif?t=1784182494 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Chat with the community, other players and discuss mysteries!</i></p>", "short_description": "Fight the machines. Survive the ruins. Uncover the truth. Echo Core is a top-down sci-fi action-adventure where you awaken in a forgotten underground facility. Explore awe-inducing locations, battle hostile machines, and uncover the truth of this place across chapters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956590/1f10346829272671bcefa45c42ab0812fec74b61/header.jpg?t=1784182494", "capsule_imag